.DS_Store
__pycache__/
# downloaded map data (tools/maps.py --fetch) and cached Overpass answers, except the compressed answers the
# examples and tests use, committed so the tests run offline (PLAN.md, VER2)
data/*
!data/osm/
data/osm/*
!data/osm/*.json.gz
# test renders; each test's RESULT.md and script are kept
**/tests/out/
# media folders EffectCraft unpacks beside a .ectemplate when rendering it directly (the zip already carries them)
**/templates/* Media/

# Temporary values files tools/demo.py writes beside an example while it renders
_demo*.values.json

# release files tools/release.py builds
dist/
